"/us/en/communications/systems/-isuite-experience": {"template":"packagedetail","metadata":{"title":"The iSuite Experience","pageTitle":"The iSuite Experience","description":"You are team-oriented. We are too. Together we share a common goal of providing exceptional patient care. This begins with the iSuite - your customized, efficient, seamlessly integrated operating room. To create your iSuite, our team will guide you through the entire process, one we’ve successfully completed thousands of times. This includes designing and planning your room, providing world-class equipment and connecting your OR to the world.","image":"/content/dam/stryker/communications/systems/isuite-experience/2022-assets/images/thumbnail.png","imageAlt":"Operating room, Stryker Operating Room, iSuite, Operating Theater, Integrated operating room","tags":["stryker:system/communications/isuite-experience","stryker:services/procare/communications/or-integration-and-connectivity","stryker:specialty/room-design","stryker:specialty/ed","stryker:content-type/system","stryker:specialty/hospital-enterprise-software","stryker:business-unit/communications","stryker:specialty/or","stryker:specialty/or-design-and-construction-resources","stryker:content-type/hcp_content","stryker:capability/infrastructure-and-room-design","stryker:specialty/monitor-and-accessory-support-arms","stryker:specialty/integration-and-connectivity","stryker:specialty/OR-integration","stryker:specialty/ICU","stryker:capability/integration-and-connectivity","stryker:specialty/emr-connectivity","stryker:specialty/asc","stryker:specialty/infrastructure-and-room-design","stryker:specialty/or-walls"],"originallyPublished":"2023-02-06T21:11:06.000Z","lastPublished":"2026-06-29T19:39:53.000Z","contentID":"COMMS-GSNPS-OTHW-163900"},"anchors":[],"disclaimer":"<p>References</p>\r\n<ol>\r\n<li>&quot;Based on a study of 106 OR personnel (surgeons, OR managers and circulating nurses) in US hospitals that have Stryker integrated operating rooms, the following information was concluded: Consequential trips and falls were reduced by 93%; An average decrease of 0.8 man-hours per case was found; Room turnover was shortened by 11 minutes on average; 95% of circulating nurses surveyed said there was no need to locate mobile equipment in order to set up the room for surgery. Improving OR Efficiency and Economics with Stryker iSuite Integration.” (pp. 3-14, White Paper). Frost and Sullivan. 2015.&nbsp;</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<div>Manufacturer part number:&nbsp;1000901877&nbsp;</div>","forms":[{"formId":"2951","afterSubmitAction":"showMessage","message":"Thank you! We have received your request. A Stryker representative will be in contact with you soon.","useProduction":true}],"tabs":[],"cardLists":[],"missingAlt":[]},
